  fullIngredientsText: "\u0E01\u0E38\u0E49\u0E07, \u0E1F\u0E31\u0E01\u0E17\u0E2D\u0E07,
    \u0E21\u0E31\u0E19\u0E2B\u0E27\u0E32\u0E19, \u0E41\u0E1B\u0E49\u0E07\u0E40\u0E17\u0E21\u0E1B\u0E38\u0E23\u0E30,
    \u0E44\u0E02\u0E48\u0E44\u0E01\u0E48, \u0E19\u0E49\u0E33\u0E40\u0E22\u0E47\u0E19,
    \u0E19\u0E49\u0E33\u0E21\u0E31\u0E19\u0E1E\u0E37\u0E0A, \u0E0B\u0E2D\u0E2A\u0E40\u0E17\u0E19\u0E2A\u0E36\u0E22\u0E38"
  sellPrice: 135
  difficulty: 2
  cookingProfile: {fileID: 0}
  customSteps: []
  obtainSource: 1
  obtainNote: "\u0E40\u0E0A\u0E1F\u0E0D\u0E35\u0E48\u0E1B\u0E38\u0E48\u0E19 \u0E40\u0E17\u0E04\u0E19\u0E34\u0E04\u0E17\u0E2D\u0E14\u0E22\u0E32\u0E01"
  mailShopLevel: 3
  mailReputation: 1830
  chef: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0a29b0691cda5cc409134a7d16c56213, type: 2}
  letterBody: 'To the owner,


    Kenji. Your shop is known even among cooks here
    now. Truly.


    Tempura is the hardest dish I know. The batter must be cold
    and barely mixed, lumps and all. The oil must be exactly right. For years mine
    came out heavy and oily, and I wanted to quit.


    The trick is to stop trying
    so hard. Mix less. Touch less. Trust the heat.


    Shrimp, pumpkin, sweet potato,
    a light flour batter, fried quickly until it crackles.


    I think people are
    the same. They don''t need to be perfect. They need to be light enough to breathe.'
